WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.350
According to the Legend of Ide that Karala told,

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:33.110
There exists an infinite source of energy somewhere in the universe.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.360
Is this energy related to the Ideon?

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.660
Or is it hidden somewhere on the Planet Solo?

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:46.250
Neither the Buff Clan, nor Cosmo and the others know.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:53.340
<b>The Deceiving White Flag</b>

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.400
Our balance is bad, can you really do this?

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.020
I won't know unless I try.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.990
Someone has to get used to this!

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.330
Incredible Gs!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.130
Don't talk! You could bite your tongue!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.840
You fool! Ease on the acceleration or we're going to die!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.550
B... But if this was a real battle...

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.060
The mobility isn't good!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.570
We won't make it!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.410
Shouldn't you let the computer do the landing?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.000
I'm doing it myself.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.460
Try not to hit the Sol Amber.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.210
Kasha's doing it? She's not using the computer?

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.920
Deck crew! Hurry!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.380
That girl! She wants to land on her own.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.800
What if she's going to crash?

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.230
Okay, stop the engine!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.190
Oh man...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.900
Inspect each machine at once!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.280
What was with that propulsion at the end?

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:48.620
There's still a few quirks that we need to iron out.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.330
Main crew, gather at the copse on the bridge!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.460
Oh, we should have chased out those flying frogs!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.260
Shoo! Shoo! Shoo!

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.000
At least they're good for something.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.760
What do you mean?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:10.310
Nothing.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.640
Sorry for being late.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.440
Thanks for the effort.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.640
What were you doing?

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.980
Well then, regarding those prisoners.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:21.150
I suggest we use them to negotiate a cease-fire with the Buff Clan.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.070
Cease-fire?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.900
A cease-fire? No!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.530
And then what?

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.950
Prepare to escape from Planet Solo.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:33.580
Karala is a woman with high status,
her allies wouldn't let her die.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.650
How do you know that?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.080
Just look how Mayaya acts.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.920
But why would a person like that head into enemy territory?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.510
Because she's like you, Kasha.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.420
Huh?

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:47.010
You're both strong willed and curious women.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.850
Sheryl!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.350
If we have to contact them anyway...

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.270
Why not propose a cease-fire?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.350
What do you think, everyone?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.020
I think it's worth trying.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.110
I'm in favor of it.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.860
We do need more time.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.660
Alright... I can at least walk...

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.660
Well then...

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.510
Bes, wait!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.230
Isn't it cowardly to suggest a cease-fire?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.730
While we have hostages, they can't attack us with their full force!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:41.190
We have the advantage! We can win!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.190
Kasha!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.360
We still can't control the Ideon properly.
It's not possible to win the fight alone...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.240
If the Ideon's control system is perfected, we can do it.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.660
Seems like you wish you were born a man, Kasha.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.830
Exactly.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.000
And your chest wouldn't be sticking out either.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:05:59.370
Bes.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.420
It seems like you have a soft spot for that Buff Clan woman.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.260
I can't stand it.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.130
I do?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.850
Tactless people like Sheryl or Kasha probably wouldn't notice...

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.390
But I'm more perceptive.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.640
Is that something a kid should say?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.310
You're shameless.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.820
The communication circuit, hurry!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.070
You kids!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:38.370
I told you it's dangerous to run in the corridor.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.750
But...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.710
We want to hurry and make a flag.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.340
I'll make a flag, so sit there like a good kid.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.930
My mom is good at cutting things.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.140
Mother?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.720
My mom would always...

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.310
Don't talk about your mother like that!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.070
Deck! Don't make her cry!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.080
There's no reply at all?

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.450
The radio waves used for communication might be fundamentally different.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.370
No. Our frequencies should intersect each other.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:26.590
It's a shame, Bes. Becoming friends with each other is difficult, isn't it?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.000
Indeed.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.420
Stop it already.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.880
We have to show them we don't intend on fighting them.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:38.720
Should I return to my ship and tell them
you want a cease-fire, then?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.770
We're not here to joke around!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:48.480
Where do you think you are? If you're
going to play, go somewhere else!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.490
Don't cry here!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.660
Sheryl!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.370
Ah, sister! Is Ashura crying?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.210
Lin. Didn't I tell you not to let children onto the bridge?

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.880
What's with that face?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.840
I'm sorry for letting the kids enter here.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:15.390
But sister, these kids have lost their parents.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.260
Can't you treat them a little better?

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:21.100
We shouldn't be playing around with kids.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.850
Get them out of here quickly!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.100
Sorry.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.900
They're nothing but trouble.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.400
Come on, Ashura, don't cry anymore.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:31.940
Let's decorate your room with these flags.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.530
Flag... A flag?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.740
That's the easiest way to let them know we want a cease-fire!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:51.380
Even if our frequencies don't meet, we have to do something!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.220
Got any sheets?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.550
Yeah, we brought some from the supermarket.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.140
Where are they?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.510
Ah, in that box over there.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.560
Cosmo! What's up?

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.600
Help me! We need to make some flags! Find some rope!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.480
Okay!

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.480
I want to make some white flags.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.780
Huh? Are we going to surrender?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.450
We need to fool the Buff Clan to buy some time!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.330
There!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.580
Okay!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.290
White flags!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.000
White flags!

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:37.840
Damn them! Did they learn about our military strength from Mayaya?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.480
What? The Logo Dau aliens raised a white flag?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.270
Yes, our recon team notified us just now.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.440
Do they mean to wipe us all out?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.690
Damn them!

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.990
Prepare to attack at once!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.550
Attention all units!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:19.090
The aliens have challenged us with a white flag!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.510
We're going to attack them indiscriminately!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:27.640
We can't refrain from leaving even one alien alive, for they will come back to
invade us later!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.350
Good luck to you all!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.440
But, Sir Damido!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.150
What is it?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.190
What about Lady Karala and Sir Gije?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.570
A white flag has been raised, understand?

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.490
Lady Karala should understand that a samurai cannot disregard it.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:50.290
As for Gije... It doesn't really matter what happens to him.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:56.750
I can advance in rank instead of Gije.
 And thus I could promote you too, Biras.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.510
Y, yes.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.470
But Lady Karala...

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.640
If something happens to her, I could just blame it on Gije, but...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.310
I'd be better if we could save her.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:08.890
Yes.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.450
What's wrong?

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.450
Why shouldn't we raise a white flag?

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.490
It's a sign that we want to surrender.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:34.830
No! White flags, white cloths, white handkerchiefs, they're all signals of provocation!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:39.330
What's worse, it means you want to eliminate them down to the last man.

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:41.910
It's the most extreme declaration of war.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:45.510
What?! B, but, what's the sign for a cease-fire then?

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.680
The color of the Ideon.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.720
That color?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.940
But your if companions saw that flag...

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.190
I don't think Gije has returned to his ship.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.360
And the patrol team is still here...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:00.610
Furthermore... Damido's not the kind of man who would let this go.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.550
Shall we release the jamming signal?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.550
First of all, we'll have to lure out that giant.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.720
Eh? What'd you say?

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:28.930
It's wrong!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.010
What is?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.220
You careless fool!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.310
What's this about?

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.860
To the aliens, a white flag means you want to fight!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.570
I've never heard a white flag meant that!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:47.410
So you're raising another one now?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.790
They took down the white flag?

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.920
They're trying to back out after that?

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.170
That's the cease-fire flag?

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.550
It's pretty!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.310
Sir Damido! The aliens seem to be requesting a cease-fire!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.640
A cease-fire?!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.810
Yes, the white flags were removed and they raised a cease-fire flag!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.400
Attack nevertheless!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:25.030
Raising and lowering flags... They're making fools of us!

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:30.660
Is that Kasha?

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.660
She's going alone?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.040
Okay!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.040
I'll show you how to use the Ideo-Buster!

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.380
It's not like I can't fight without transforming into the Ideon!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.970
I'll get all three of you at the same time!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.190
You're pretty bold!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.240
I did it!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.490
Damn you!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.250
It's going slow!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.500
It'd be good if we could defeat it before it turns into the Giant!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.130
Another one's here, Biras!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.470
Is that Sir Abadede?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:35.850
No, he'd use the Dogg Mack-type Heavy Mobile Mecha.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.940
But those aliens...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.150
Why would they attack after raising a cease-fire flag?

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.860
Tell Kasha and Cosmo to retreat!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:53.030
But they've already met up!
They're engaged with the enemy!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.990
But we raised the cease-fire flag!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:59.160
But can we really believe what that alien woman said?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.170
Launch!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.380
You're too naïve!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.550
Like the radio said, they've raised a cease-fire flag!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.230
That doesn't match their behavior!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.890
We'll answer their cease-fire by taking down those three Giant machines!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.180
Yes!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.710
Take care of the enemy, Techno!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.000
I've got to do something about that idiot, Kasha!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.000
Okay.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:48.920
We've already requested a cease-fire, though! Can we really do this?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.680
Kasha, can you hear me? Raise the nose or you'll fall!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.060
H... Huh? Alright...

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.310
Wake up, Kasha!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.570
Kasha, do you hear me!?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.530
Keep it under your control so we can dock!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.040
Eh? Yes! Docking!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:28.250
Kasha! Get within the barrier's range and
 stabilize your machine! Can you hear me?

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.460
Start transformation!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.090
Fire missiles and cover them so the enemy can't get close.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.220
Okay! Ideo-Nova, transform! Let's dock!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.450
Kasha, hurry!

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:55.240
Roger!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.260
It seems they're protected by the barrier Gije told about. Biras!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:17.180
Yes! However, I can't detect any barrier-like electromagnetic field around it.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.600
Alright, let's try attacking with the Gil Baus!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:27.440
No! I can't control it! Cosmo, Bes, behind us!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.980
They're trying to fight at close range?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:35.860
What's this?

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.910
Cosmo, the enemy's coming from behind us!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.340
What's with these childish tactics?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:59.930
Shake them off! All gun platforms, attack them with our missiles!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.430
Missiles, fire!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:18.990
Attack the eye! The control center should be located there!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:19.490
Roger!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.160
I can't control it! Damn them!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.160
They've killed the monitors!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.000
We're being struck by strong electro-magnetic jamming!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.750
If we don't do something soon we won't
be able to use this machine's system!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.050
The Ideon's missiles might explode!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:34.960
What!?

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.720
Kasha, can you hear me? Fire all the missiles!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.640
Bes?! What did you say?! I can't hear you!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:43.930
The missiles...

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:46.180
Strike with our missiles!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.350
We're getting beaten!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.940
These controls aren't responding!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:59.360
That means we should... Bes! Cut the engine! Stop all engines!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.920
We're falling!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.130
We're falling!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:45.410
Damn that Damido! He should attack the spaceship and save Lady Karala instead!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.370
The power is back! It's up to you, Techno!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:07.470
We hit them!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.270
Sir Damido!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.940
Who is the commander? This is Gije!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.280
The enemy has sent out a cease-fire sign!

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.530
The communication line is open. It's me.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.500
Damido? Didn't you see the cease-fire flag?

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.120
Cease-fire flag?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.960
I was only informed about a white flag.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.170
I haven't heard about that!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.300
We still have a chance to save Lady Karala!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.840
Let's pull out of here!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.920
Just in time, huh?

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:59.610
Why'd they suddenly stop attacking?

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.240
Isn't this our chance? We can chase them and strike them down!

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:05.070
Enough of that, Kasha!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.030
It's all your fault that we got into a difficult fight!

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:11.370
If Cosmo hadn't been here, they would have killed you.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.830
Understood.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.880
Please don't lay your hands on my lady!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.180
You said the color of Ideon was the symbol for cease-fire!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.140
Wasn't that a lie?!
You said the color of Ideon was the symbol for cease-fire!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:32.140
Wait! We can kill them any time!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.470
Why are you protecting them?

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.060
I'm not protecting them, we still have use for these two!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.060
Wait!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.860
Bes, how do you think we should deal with these two?

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:43.610
What you mean "deal with"?

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:46.030
Kill them! Kill the liars!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.370
No! These two haven't lied to us.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.990
The enemy stopped attacking because
they recognized we wanted a cease-fire.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:58.750
But Bes, what are you going to do about their punishment? The people won't be satisfied like this.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.550
That'd be careless.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:04.270
We don't know that much about the enemy. We can't fight like this!

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:08.920
We have to learn as much as possible about the enemy from these two.

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:11.970
That's why we need to interrogate them.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:15.270
I'll accept it, Jordan Bes.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.980
I'll answer everyone's questions.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:19.350
Lady Karala!

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:21.980
My Lady, are you going to sell out the Buff Clan?

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.070
Are you going to abandon your home?

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:29.490
No. I just want to end the fighting as soon as possible.

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:31.660
Ms. Sheryl?

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>The attempt to contact the aliens ended up in failure.</i>

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:58.930
<i>The Buff Clan give up on rescuing Karala and relentlessly attack the Solo Ship.</i>

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:02.350
<i>Cosmo and the others escape into the subspace.</i>

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>However, the Buff Clan's Heavy Mobile
Mecha attacks the Ideon in subspace!</i>

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:14.580
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Escape into Subspace"</i>

